  "scope": [
    "Read-only inspection of supplier AAR bytes; no native build, simulator or runtime test.",
    "13 AARs and 50 inspected 64-bit entries include debug/release variants, repeated shared libraries and both old/new JNA. This is NOT an inventory of 50 retained APK libraries.",
    "The Mac-local developmentDebug APK SHA256 8d73e790f9b47766c92e927d7fe8425ad4967cfe44607cf35312cbb87e469af8 was unavailable in Cloud. Its reported 49/59 raw RELRO-end flags cannot be enumerated or classified here.",
    "The JNA 5.14.0 x86_64 supplier entry fails static checks but the app explicitly excludes lib/x86_64/libjnidispatch.so. The arm64 entry remains a declared production input.",
    "AAR ZIP offsets are not final APK ZIP proof. Source-built adapters, final APK packaging and Android strict-16KB runtime remain separate checks.",
    "An unaligned raw RELRO end alone does not imply Android 17 strict-mode rejection when RELRO covers its complete matching LOAD."
  ],
